+    // The login flow resolves the final GameProfile (after AsyncPlayerPreLoginEvent) well before
+    // the configuration phase reads playerdata/stats/advancements - at least one client RTT of
+    // wall-clock time in which the main thread is idle. The reads (gzip+NBT parse+datafix for
+    // .dat, strict JSON parse for stats/advancements) are issued onto the ordered write chains
+    // for their files in that window, so the main-thread consumption point normally finds them
+    // already complete. Caches are keyed by resolved path and consumed exactly once; unconsumed
+    // entries are dropped from the login/configuration disconnect hooks.
+    private final java.util.concurrent.ConcurrentHashMap<Path, java.util.concurrent.CompletableFuture<com.google.gson.JsonElement>> papoStatsPrefetches =
